        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Yang Yo-seob, Kim Tae-yeon, Taeyeon, Sunny, Tiffany, Hyoyeon, Yuri, Sooyoung, Yoona, Seohyun\n- Organizations: Highlight, S.M. Entertainment, Starlight Academy, Girls' Generation\n- Products: The First Collage\n\nFacts:\n- Kim Tae-yeon was a trainee at S.M. Entertainment's Starlight Academy during her middle school years.\n- Kim Tae-yeon debuted as a member of Girls' Generation in 2007.\n- The First Collage is the debut and first EP by Yang Yo-seob, and it was released on November 26, 2012.\n- Yang Yo-seob is the main vocalist of the boy group Highlight.\n- Girls' Generation is composed of eight members: Taeyeon, Sunny, Tiffany, Hyoyeon, Yuri, Sooyoung, Yoona, and Seohyun.",
